<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Howth: free cliffs and a €1 bus ride from Dublin | Pennies Abroad</title>
<meta name="description" content="A day in Howth can cost under €20: a €1 bus from Dublin, free cliff walks, and €15 takeaway fish and chips.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@600;700;800&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#14304A; --slate:#4F6B84; --sun:#F6BC3E; --gold:#9C6B0C;
  --sky:#2B84C4; --teal:#155A85; --wash:#EAF3FC; --mist:#CFE4F3; --white:#FFFFFF;
  --display:"Baloo 2", "Nunito", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --body:"Nunito", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  --mono:"Space Mono", ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
  padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
body{margin:0;background:var(--white);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);font-size:1.075rem;line-height:1.7}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:var(--teal);text-underline-offset:3px}
a:hover{color:var(--sky)}
a:focus-visible,.btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--sky);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:6px}

/* Header */
.site-header{border-bottom:2px dotted var(--mist)}
.site-header .inner{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px 24px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 28px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.logo{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;line-height:1}
.logo:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.site-header nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 22px}
.site-header nav a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
.site-header nav a:hover,.site-header nav a[aria-current]{color:var(--teal);text-decoration:underline}

/* Hero */
.hero{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px 0}
.hero-text{max-width:720px}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin:0 0 10px}
h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5.4vw,3.6rem);line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.subhead{font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.2vw,1.35rem);color:var(--slate);margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.5}
.meta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--slate);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 18px;margin:0}
.cover{margin:32px 0 0;position:relative}
.cover img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/8;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 72%;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--mist)}
.cover .badge{position:absolute;left:20px;bottom:20px}

/* Price badge and chips */
.badge{display:inline-block;background:var(--sun);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1;padding:12px 16px 9px;border-radius:14px}
.chip{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 10px 3px;border-radius:999px;vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap}
.chip.free{background:#DDEBF3;color:var(--teal)}
.chip.paid{background:#F4E6C6;color:var(--gold)}

/* At a glance strip */
.glance{max-width:1080px;margin:28px auto 0;padding:0 24px}
.glance ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:18px 22px;background:var(--wash);border-radius:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:14px 24px}
.glance li{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.glance .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.74rem;color:var(--slate)}
.glance .v{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.2}

/* Article */
article{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px 24px}
article>*{max-width:680px}
article p{margin:0 0 1.1em}
h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.2rem);line-height:1.15;margin:2.2em 0 .6em}
h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.35rem,2.6vw,1.6rem);line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 .5em;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 12px}
.divider{border:0;border-top:2px dotted var(--mist);margin:2.4em 0}
.thing{margin:2.4em 0 0}
.num{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;color:var(--gold)}
figure{margin:1.4em 0 1.6em}
figure img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--mist)}
figure.tall img{aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover}
figcaption{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--slate);margin-top:8px}
.tip{background:var(--wash);border-left:4px solid var(--sun);border-radius:0 14px 14px 0;padding:14px 18px;margin:1.2em 0}
.tip strong{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-right:6px}

/* Receipt */
.receipt{margin:1.2em 0 1.6em;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--mist);border-radius:18px;padding:22px 24px 20px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.92rem}
.receipt .head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--slate);font-size:.78rem;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:2px dotted var(--mist);margin-bottom:8px}
.receipt .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:8px 0}
.receipt .row span:last-child{white-space:nowrap}
.receipt .total{border-top:2px dotted var(--mist);margin-top:8px;padding-top:14px;align-items:center;font-weight:700}
.receipt .total .badge{font-size:1.15rem}
.receipt .alt{color:var(--teal);font-size:.84rem;padding-top:10px}

/* CTA */
.cta{text-align:left;margin:2.4em 0 0;padding:26px 24px;background:var(--wash);border-radius:20px}
.cta p{margin:0 0 14px;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1.3}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--sun);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:999px}
.btn:hover{color:var(--ink);background:#F1AE1E}

/* Footer */
footer{border-top:2px dotted var(--mist);margin-top:56px}
footer .inner{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px 24px 34px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 28px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--slate)}
footer .logo{font-size:1.2rem}

@media (max-width:600px){
  .hero{padding-top:32px}
  .cover img{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:16px;object-position:center 70%}
  .cover .badge{left:12px;bottom:12px;font-size:1.05rem}
  article{padding-top:28px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="inner">
    <a class="logo" href="../index.html#home">Pennies Abroad</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main">
      <a href="../index.html#home">Home</a>
      <a href="../index.html#map">Cost map</a>
      <a href="../index.html#blog" aria-current="page">Blog</a>
      <a href="../index.html#traveltips">Travel tips</a>
      <a href="../index.html#resources">Budget resources</a>
      <a href="../index.html#about">About me</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Day trips from Dublin</p>
      <h1>Howth: free cliffs and a €1 bus ride from Dublin</h1>
      <p class="subhead">A day in this seaside village can cost under €20, and the best part is free.</p>
      <p class="meta"><span>By Juliana</span><span>Howth, County Dublin</span><span>Last updated: October 2026</span></p>
    </div>
    <figure class="cover">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="View over the rooftops of Howth to the harbour and the island of Ireland’s Eye on a clear, sunny evening." width="1400" height="1050">
      <span class="badge">Day trip from about €17</span>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="glance" aria-label="Howth at a glance">
    <ul>
      <li><span class="k">Bus from Dublin</span><span class="v">€1 each way</span></li>
      <li><span class="k">Cliff walk</span><span class="v">Free</span></li>
      <li><span class="k">Fish and chips</span><span class="v">€15 to 25</span></li>
      <li><span class="k">Travel time</span><span class="v">About 1 hour</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <article>
    <p>The cliffs at Howth are free, the bus from Dublin is €1 each way with a Leap Card, and takeaway fish and chips is about €15. Add seals in the harbour, a boardwalk along the water, and cute local shops, and you have one of the easiest day trips from Dublin.</p>
    <p>Howth is a fishing village on a small peninsula in Fingal, County Dublin, about an hour’s bus ride from the city centre. If you’re anywhere near Dublin, put it on your list before you leave.</p>

    <h2>3 things to know before you visit Howth</h2>

    <section class="thing">
      <h3><span><span class="num">1.</span> The Howth cliffs</span> <span class="chip free">Free</span></h3>
      <p>These are the kind of cliffs you see in movies, high above the sea. You don’t need a tour or a ticket, and they’re a quick walk from the centre of the village.</p>
      <figure>
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Two people running hand in hand up a hill covered in heather and yellow gorse on the Howth cliffs." width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Photo by Rachel Alice Photography, Dublin.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="thing">
      <h3><span><span class="num">2.</span> The weather can make or break your trip</span></h3>
      <p>We went on a windy, rainy weekend and could barely see anything. Walking the boardwalk was a struggle, and we held onto our bags for dear life. When the weather cleared near the end of the trip, it was absolutely worth the wait.</p>
      <figure class="tall">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Juliana laughing in a long green coat, hair blowing in the wind, by the rocky shore in Howth on a grey day." width="1050" height="1400" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Day one: wind, rain, and not much of a view. The clear sky in the cover photo came at the end of the trip.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <p class="tip"><strong>Tip:</strong> Check the forecast before you go, and bring a rain jacket either way.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="thing">
      <h3><span><span class="num">3.</span> Fish and chips is cheaper to take away</span> <span class="chip paid">€15 vs €25</span></h3>
      <p>Howth is known for its seafood, and the fish and chips is worth it. Where you eat it changes the price, though. We sat down at a restaurant along the coast and paid €25. The same meal to take away is about €15.</p>
      <figure class="tall">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A plate of battered fish and chips with mushy peas and tartar sauce on a wooden table." width="1050" height="1400" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Our sit-down fish and chips: €25.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <p class="tip"><strong>Tip:</strong> Seafood restaurants often have a wait on weekends. Taking your food to go saves you time as well as €10, and you can eat it by the water.</p>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider">

    <h2>Getting there (€1 each way)</h2>
    <p>We took the bus from Dublin city centre, which took about an hour and cost €1 each way with a Leap Card. Fares can change, so check current prices on <a href="https://www.transportforireland.ie/">Transport for Ireland</a> before you go.</p>

    <h2>What we spent</h2>
    <div class="receipt" role="table" aria-label="What we spent in Howth">
      <div class="head" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Item</span><span role="columnheader">Cost</span></div>
      <div class="row" role="row"><span role="cell">Bus there and back (Leap Card)</span><span role="cell">€2</span></div>
      <div class="row" role="row"><span role="cell">Howth cliffs</span><span role="cell">€0</span></div>
      <div class="row" role="row"><span role="cell">Sit-down fish and chips</span><span role="cell">€25</span></div>
      <div class="row total" role="row"><span role="cell">Our day</span><span role="cell"><span class="badge">€27</span></span></div>
      <div class="alt">Get your fish and chips to take away and it’s about €17.</div>
    </div>

    <h2>Final thoughts</h2>
    <p>Howth was 100% worth the trip. The cliffs are free, the views are unreal, and the whole day can cost less than a night out in Dublin. Between the walk and browsing the local shops, it’s an easy, cheap escape from the city.</p>
    <p>Have you been to Howth? Did you get lucky with the weather, or were you holding onto your bags like we were?</p>

    <div class="cta">
      <p>Planning more trips on a student budget?</p>
      <a class="btn" href="../index.html#blog">Read the blog</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="inner">
    <a class="logo" href="../index.html#home">Pennies Abroad</a>
    <span>penniesabroad.netlify.app</span>
    <span>Instagram @penniesabroad</span>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
